        199,
        2435,
        1956,
        2586
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, implementation of such local law requires the creation of an organizational structure to fulfill the Housing and Development Administration's myriad responsibilities, and",
      "logprob_stats": {
